      "explanation": "First evaluate \\(f(4)\\), since its value becomes the second input of \\(F\\):\n\\[\nf(4)=4-2=2.\n\\]\nIn \\(F(a,b)=b^2+a\\), the second input is squared and the first input is added. Therefore\n\\[\nF[3,f(4)]=F(3,2)=2^2+3=7.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(7\\), choice C.",
